@startuml
' Product diagram contract: UC-1..UC-8, BR-1..BR-23
left to right direction

actor "Solo Player" as Player
actor "Storybook Source" as Source
actor "AI Game Master" as GM

rectangle "Scenario Model Runtime" {
  usecase "UC-1\n시나리오 컴파일" as UC1
  usecase "UC-2\n시작 전 재컴파일" as UC2
  usecase "UC-3\n모험 시작 및 첫 Situation 생성" as UC3
  usecase "UC-4\nGM Turn 진행" as UC4
  usecase "UC-5\nRAG fallback으로\nRuntime-added Fact 생성" as UC5
  usecase "UC-6\nSituation 전환" as UC6
  usecase "UC-7\n스포일러 안전 서술" as UC7
  usecase "UC-8\n해결 조건 충족 후 완료" as UC8
}

Player --> UC1
Player --> UC2
Player --> UC3
Player --> UC4

Source --> UC1
Source --> UC5
GM --> UC4
GM --> UC7

UC2 .> UC1 : <<include>>
UC3 .> UC4 : 첫 Scene
UC4 .> UC5 : 필요한 사실이 source에 없을 때
UC4 .> UC6 : 문제 상태가 의미 있게 변할 때
UC4 .> UC7 : player-visible output 전
UC4 .> UC8 : resolution condition 충족 시

note bottom of UC1
Storybook 필수.
다중 Storybook이면 Primary 지정.
Integration Prompt와 Creativity를 적용한다.
end note

note bottom of UC5
기존 플레이 사실과 충돌하지 않는
최소 사실만 생성하고,
Turn commit 때 함께 확정한다.
end note

@enduml
